## Queue history

The reports arrived from April onward, but their merge dates differ. The chart keeps
received and merged separate rather than treating the merge date as when the bug began.

<QueueTimeline ticket={4471} />

## Triage correction

The existing [subject-line dedupe rule](/kb/triage/dedupe) cannot establish that two
reports have the same cause. Keep the parser reports together under #4471, separate the
booking-v3 hint reports, and reconcile each ticket's count from distinct report IDs.
Do not close the second issue when the parser fix ships: test the form hint and parsing
independently for a day-first tenant.

